Description: neon screensaver animations for Wayland desktops
 xway-screensaver shows neon screensaver animations, such as Polyglow and
 Lightspeed, as one continuous scene across every monitor. It works on
 Wayland compositors with the wlr-layer-shell and ext-idle-notify
 protocols, such as COSMIC, KDE Plasma, Sway, Hyprland and niri.
 .
 It does not lock the screen; keep your desktop's own lock screen for that.
